.9371L121.706 14.025Z\" fill=\"#A4A4A4\"><\/path>\n<\/svg>","sectionDesc-1":"2,000+ reviews on <svg class=\"star-icons\" width=\"19\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 19 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\n<path d=\"M18.5368 6.61836H11.4584L9.27201 0L7.07787 6.61891L0 6.61172L5.73252 10.7058L3.53949 17.317L9.27201 13.2295L14.9979 17.317L12.8115 10.7058L18.5368 6.61836Z\" fill=\"#02B57B\"><\/path>\n<path d=\"M13.3035 12.2028L12.8114 10.7059L9.27246 13.2296L13.3035 12.2028Z\" fill=\"#126849\"><\/path>\n<\/svg>\nStamped &amp; Trustpilot","sectionDescUrl":"shopify:\/\/pages\/review"}},"home_reviews_swiper_r8FNj9":{"type":"home-reviews-swiper","blocks":{"left_item_yNiEUj":{"type":"leftItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-0.webp","reviewItemTitle":"The True Experience","reviewItemDesc":"Very easy to assemble, took like 15 minutes. The comfort level is better every gaming chair i've had previously, I can literally recline and fall asleep in it. The built in lumbar system is immaculate as well. Overall, the best chair money can buy. Thanks Dad for getting it for Christmas and thank you all at Blacklyte for designing an amazing chair.","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Rick P. ","reviewItemCountry":"United States"}},"left_item_T7pj76":{"type":"leftItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-1.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Best gaming chair I had yet!","reviewItemDesc":"Just recently got my Athena pro chair! This is literally what I’ve been missing out on the past 5 years of my streaming and work life! The quality and build of this chair is worth the price! I had my family also tear it out and sat in my old one first to show and comparison and this literally blows my previous one off the charts! Recommend for anyone and with back problems! Do yourself a favour and purchase it without regrets! Trust me! You will thank my review or blacklyte!","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Michael S.","reviewItemCountry":"Canada"}},"left_item_GxFKiJ":{"type":"leftItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-2.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Epic gaming chair","reviewItemDesc":"Easy assembly, very comfortabel. Good price for this quality","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Tom O.","reviewItemCountry":"Netherlands"}},"left_item_aaiqxC":{"type":"leftItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-3.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Excellent chair, Excellent service","reviewItemDesc":"I have purchased 2 Athena chairs and they are very comfortable. I have used the first one for about 4 months now and has broken in nicely. I am very happy with it. So happy that I bought one for my wife. When I put hers together, I accidentally dropped it on the armrest and broke the latch on the front to rear sliding pad. I contacted customer support and let them know what happened and the just replaced it for free. Thank you Blacklyte!","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Daniel S.","reviewItemCountry":"United States"}},"item_fzhQpi":{"type":"item","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-4.webp","reviewItemTitle":"High-Quality and Comfortable Chair","reviewItemDesc":"I’m very satisfied with the Athena Pro Gaming Chair. It’s extremely comfortable for long sessions and feels very sturdy and well-built. The materials are high quality, the armrests are adjustable, and the support is excellent. A great investment if you want both comfort and performance. Highly recommended!","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Benoit H.","reviewItemCountry":"Canada"}},"item_ykAeWd":{"type":"item","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-5.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Holds up to hours of both office and gaming","reviewItemDesc":"So I bought this to replace an old other gaming chair that is very popular and comes from a certain Lab. This chair is by far comfier and not as hard. I will say though it's very fiddly to get the back into the bottom and the only way to do it properly is to slowly screw all four screws at the same time little by little, it was very time consuming and frustrating to figure this out. That said, I love the chair and it looks great too.","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Ben M.","reviewItemCountry":"Australia"}},"item_eyxKCb":{"type":"item","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-6.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Awesome quality","reviewItemDesc":"First impression, good quality materials. Awesome for the price.","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Fernando F.","reviewItemCountry":"Portugal"}},"item_B9iLMG":{"type":"item","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-7.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Great chair","reviewItemDesc":"I love this chair, looks better in person than I even expected. I love the recline and rocking features. Just wish blacklyte had accessories for the chair like a reclining footrest add on, or different color arm rest options. But everything else is great. It is firm but comfortable and assembly was quick and easy!","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"David C.","reviewItemCountry":"United States"}},"right_item_nb8nwq":{"type":"rightItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-8.webp","reviewItemTitle":"Best chair for its price","reviewItemDesc":"The Blacklyte Athena Pro feels surprisingly premium for its price and easily stands on par with other high-end gaming chairs on the market. The overall build quality gives off a solid, well-made feel that you’d expect from more expensive options.The neck pillow is soft and comfortable, providing good support during long sessions. While the chair itself feels a bit on the firm side, it’s still comfortable and supportive, especially for extended gaming or work hours.","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Matt M.","reviewItemCountry":"United States"}},"right_item_ycTA3B":{"type":"rightItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-9.webp","reviewItemTitle":"High expectations, still better than expected","reviewItemDesc":"Very comfortable, high quality, top customer service","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Cesar V.","reviewItemCountry":"Germany"}},"right_item_N8QDRA":{"type":"rightItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-10.webp","reviewItemTitle":"AMAZING Chair","reviewItemDesc":"This chair is pure brilliance , paid a little extra money for this and was a little sceptical at first but what can I said the price is defiantly worth what you get . Comfy to the max for long gaming sessions","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"ryan f.","reviewItemCountry":"United Kingdom"}},"right_item_fgVXBn":{"type":"rightItem","settings":{"reviewItemImage":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mainpageReviews-11.webp","reviewItemTitle":"A very comfy chair","reviewItemDesc":"I like this chair a lot. The microfibre is super soft and the foam is comfy. The chair was easy to put together and the instructions clear. It's a marked improvement from my last chair.","rating":5,"reviewItemName":"Ian C.","reviewItemCountry":"Canada"}}},"block_order":["left_item_yNiEUj","left_item_T7pj76","left_item_GxFKiJ","left_item_aaiqxC","item_fzhQpi","item_ykAeWd","item_eyxKCb","item_B9iLMG","right_item_nb8nwq","right_item_ycTA3B","right_item_N8QDRA","right_item_fgVXBn"],"name":"Home Reviews Swiper","settings":{"sectionTitle":"200,000+","sectionSubTitle":"What 200,000+ Gamers are Saying","sectionDescripe":"We don’t cut corners when it comes to your well-being. We fine-tune every desk, chair or accessory until it meets our strict standards - and yours. Apparently lots of you agree - with over 10,000 5-star reviews, see why so many trust Blacklyte as their go-to ergonomic brand.","sectionLearnMore":"Learn More"}},"home_newsletter_new_TLtgUm":{"type":"home-newsletter-new","name":"Home Newsletter","settings":{"sectionBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","sectionTitle":"Get €30 off your first order!","sectionDescripe":"Subscribe 